1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,321
你在做什么
What's cooking?

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:07,100
我妈传给我的菜谱  豚鼠派
My mother's recipe -- guinea-pig pie.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:07,702
闻起来很香
Smells good.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,961
你都不怀疑一下吗  其实是山核桃派
You just accept that? It's pecan.

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,230
你觉得我们国家的人疯狂到吃豚鼠吗
How cuckoo do you think my country is?

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:12,981
我竟沦落至此
It's come to this --

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,747
"你在做什么"和"闻起来很香"
"What's cooking" and "Smells good"

8
00:00:14,788 --> 00:00:15,520
都会让我挨骂
gets me in trouble?

9
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,201
妈  你现在就开始准备明天的菜了吗
Mom, you're already cooking for tomorrow?

10
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,361
你不用这么小题大做
Don't make a big deal.

11
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,300
我的宝贝儿子毕业了
My baby's graduating.

12
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,060
他获得了品性正直奖
He won the award for Integrity and Character.

13
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,300
"从不旷课  从不迟到
"No absents, no tardies,

14
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,220
尊重同学及师长"
respectful to student and teachers alike."

15
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,810
我的学校当年也有这么个奖
My school had an award like that,

16
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,566
但那孩子获得的不是绶带
but instead of a sash, that kid

17
00:00:31,606 --> 00:00:32,540
而是迎面一拳
got a punch in the mouth.

18
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:33,402
不过我很为你骄傲
Proud of you, though.

19
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,660
为什么你所有的故事都涉及迎面一拳
Why do all your stories involve a punch in the face,

20
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:38,240
一个诡异的欧洲人或一个经验丰富的骚女
a shifty European, or a broad who's been around the block?

21
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:40,750
这让我想起有次我揍了个意大利小子
That reminds me of when I had to rough up this Italian kid

22
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,141
因为他不想让我和他妹妹约会
because he didn't want me dating his sister.

23
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,101
那姑娘可不是乖乖女
She was no nun!

24
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:45,724
-杰  你帮我处理下牛排好吗  -好
- Jay, can you please take care of the steaks? - Sure.

25
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,980
在你毕业大典前夜  我们吃肋眼牛排庆祝
On the eve of your big day, we're celebrating with rib eyes,

26
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:51,320
然后我陪你喝你第一杯威士忌
and you and I are gonna have our first scotch.

27
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,603
-真的吗  -真的
- Really?! - Yeah.

28
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:55,380
我一直在等机会开这瓶典藏威士忌
I've been waiting to open a special bottle.

29
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,001
看来被老鼠偷喝了不少
Huh. Looks like the mice got into it.

30
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,580
人呢人呢  我儿子人呢
Hello, hello?! Where's my son?

31
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:01,402
爸
Dad!

32
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:02,821
他是翻大门进来的吗
What, did he hop the gate?

33
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:04,321
你居然来了
You came!

34
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,441
我说过我会来
I said I'd come.

35
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,941
我知道  但你居然真的来了
I know, but you came!

36
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:08,001
我怎能错过
How could I miss it?

37
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,310
曼尼  我们家族史上
Manny, the first member of my family

38
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,221
-第一个从高中毕业的人  -等等
- to ever graduate from high school. - Wait a minute.

39
00:01:12,232 --> 00:01:14,040
你不是有个兄弟在哥伦比亚行医吗
Don't you have a brother in Colombia who's a doctor?

40
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:14,523
是的
Yes.

41
