他不过做些正畸手术而已
He just does orthopedic surgery,

42
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:17,720
又不给大脑或心脏开刀
no brain or heart.

43
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:19,596
想象一下  明天我会看著你
Think of it -- Tomorrow, I will watch you

44
00:01:19,636 --> 00:01:21,470
戴著绶带昂首阔步走上领奖台
stride across the stage with a sash,

45
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,723
像个狠角色戴著弹药带
like a rebel's bandolier

46
00:01:22,804 --> 00:01:25,500
向世界宣告"从不旷课  从不迟到"
telling the world "No absents, no tardies."

47
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,450
曼尼和我打算烤点牛排
Manny and I were gonna grill some steaks

48
00:01:27,461 --> 00:01:29,140
再喝点  啤酒
and drink some, um, beers.

49
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,530
谢谢你  杰  但如果你不介意
Thank you, Jay, but if it's all right with you,

50
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:32,851
我想带曼尼出去
I would like to take Manny out

51
00:01:32,861 --> 00:01:35,220
搞点父子间的特别庆祝活动
for a special father-son celebration.

52
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:36,821
我可以去吗
Is that okay?

53
00:01:37,526 --> 00:01:40,360
当然  毕竟他费了功夫来这一趟
Ah, sure. I mean, he... made the effort to come.

54
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:42,001
百忙之中都不顾上系好衬衫扣子
Didn't have time to button his shirt all the way up.

55
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:43,741
但...  去吧
But... go ahead.

56
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:45,181
太棒了  夜生活现在开始
Perfect! The night begins.

57
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,160
但首先  来
But first... here.

58
