我们在洗手池里给他洗澡
we'd give him a bath in the sink.

86
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:42,441
又来了
Here we go.

87
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,141
爸  我们真得好好谈谈你爱哭这件事
Dad, we really got to talk about the crying.

88
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:46,501
我们毕业时你哭得一塌糊涂  特别丢人
When we graduated, you were a mess, and it was humiliating.

89
00:02:46,620 --> 00:02:49,160
现代性感男性不畏惧展示感性的一面
Showing emotion is part of being a sexy modern man.

90
