我也该送你们一份礼物
You deserve a gift.

96
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:05,060
但我该送父母界中的凯迪拉克什么礼物
But what do you get the Cadillac of parents?

97
00:03:05,740 --> 00:03:05,908
一辆莱斯莱斯
A Rolls-Royce.

98
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,161
我的天
Oh, my goodness!

99
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,141
你怎么买得起
How did you afford that?

100
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,500
这车才卖两千美元
It was only $2,000.

101
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:14,501
俱乐部的汤普森法官带我去了警方拍卖会
Judge Thompson, from the club, got me into a police auction.

102
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:16,921
如果当时我还有四十美元就给你们买快艇了
If I had 40 more dollars, you'd be looking at a speedboat.

103
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:19,101
你们喜欢吗
So, what do you think?

104
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:21,461
真...  真不一般
It's... It's wow.

105
00:03:21,940 --> 00:03:22,391
是吧
Right?!

106
00:03:22,401 --> 00:03:25,730
我喜欢他一年级时用通心粉给我做的项链
I loved the macaroni necklace he made me in first grade,

107
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:28,710
我甚至用了他五年级时送我的香水
and I even used the perfume he gave me in fifth grade,

108
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,320
但这辆车实在太俗艳了
but this car is so gaudy.

109
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:33,820
人们会以为我是七十年代的尼克斯队球星
People are gonna think I played for the Knicks in the '70s.

110
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:38,060
我从没见过这么让人感动的礼物
It's the most beautiful gesture I have ever seen.

111
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:39,841
这车百分百经典上档次
It's 100% class.

112
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:42,380
妈  你不是有些杂事要办吗
Hey, Mom, didn't you say you had some errands to run?

113
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,720
我本打算一会儿再出门
Oh. I -- In a little while.

114
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,742
是啊  但  天啊  还有皮草
Uh, s-- Yeah, but -- Um, gosh, it's got fur. Wow.

115
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:50,430
就好像驾驶著狮子
It's like driving a lion.

116
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:53,040
你走之前  按个喇叭
Hey, before you go, give us a honk.

117
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,401
好吧
All right.

118
00:03:59,372 --> 00:04:00,720
喇叭也没好一点  是吧
The horn doesn't help, does it?

119
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:16,107
我把范围缩小到  瑞士咖啡白色
So, I've narrowed it down to Swiss Coffee

120
