我忘了给你们这个
Okay. I forgot to give this to you.

128
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,260
谢谢  在学校过得开心啊  亲爱的
Oh, thank you. Have a good day at school, sweetie.

129
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:30,702
再见  亲爱的
Bye, sweetie.

130
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,740
四年级而已  我们就只是踩水玩
It's fourth grade. We're all just treading water.

131
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:34,282
这是什么
What is it?

132
