你确定不是给莉莉·罗森的吗
Are you sure it's not for Lily Rosen?

137
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,660
你也去了学校科学展览
You were at that science fair.

138
00:04:44,670 --> 00:04:45,961
她救活了一只青蛙
She brought that frog back to life!

139
