这是给我们的莉莉的
This is for our Lily.

140
00:04:48,138 --> 00:04:49,310
他们建议她跳过五年级
T-They're suggesting that she skip fifth grade

141
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,821
明年直接上初中
and go right into middle school next year.

142
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,814
"经测验  莉莉远高于
"Lily is testing

143
00:04:51,977 --> 00:04:53,544
-她所在年级的水平  -什么
- far above her grade level... - What?

144
00:04:53,554 --> 00:04:54,710
我们认为她会受益于
