145
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,301
更具挑战性的课程"
from a more challenging curriculum."

146
00:04:58,005 --> 00:05:01,570
对啊  这些年我们以为她
I know! All these years we thought that she was, uh --

147
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:02,461
天啊  什么词来著
