150
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:09,080
太多了  但结果她是真的很聪明
So many words. But she was just really smart.

151
00:05:09,565 --> 00:05:11,550
她每天放学窝在房间里  不是在
Holed up in her room every day after school, she wasn't --

152
