我要说的是做白日梦
I was gonna say daydreaming.

154
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:16,070
他们想我们有空的话今天到学校参观
They -- They want us to tour the school today if possible.

155
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,541
太让人激动了
This is so exciting.

156
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:19,101
我们的小宝贝是个天才
Our little baby's a genius!

157
