我也跳过一级
You know, um, I also skipped a grade.

158
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:23,990
我不是说我是天才  但...
I'm not saying I was a genius, but --

159
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,020
那就好  因为我们现在相处融洽
Good, because we're getting along so well right now.

160
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:28,761
给你
Here you go.

161
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,701
-太谢谢了  -你猜怎么著
- Thanks so much. - Hey, guess what.

162
00:05:30,710 --> 00:05:31,901
他们想让莉莉跳过五年级
They want Lily to skip fifth grade.

163
00:05:31,980 --> 00:05:33,630
通常来说  说你猜怎么著的那个人
Traditionally, the person who says "Guess what"

164
