可以负责说出谜底
also gets to say the what.

165
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:36,581
等下  莉莉是聪明的吗
Wait a second. Lily's smart?

166
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:38,221
有什么证据吗
Look. I mean, there's proof of that?

167
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,041
当然  这儿有
Yeah. Right there. Yes.

168
