他们也让艾丽克斯跳级
They asked Alex to skip a grade, too...

169
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,220
这不是个竞赛  克莱尔
It's not a competition, Claire.

170
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:45,390
但我们觉得让她和年纪太大的孩子一起
...but we felt that it would be too much stress

171
