说"果然被我料中了"如何
How 'bout "Nailed it"?

513
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:50,070
打从我第一眼看到那台车我就想要了
I wanted that sweet ride from the moment I saw it,

514
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:52,260
但我知道我爸妈绝对不会让我买
but I knew my parents would never let me get it.

515
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:55,620
我也知道如果我送他们  他们绝不会收
I also knew they'd never keep it if I gave it to them, so...

