如果我不出现在珍娜家
There are nine girls who will freak

523
00:20:09,450 --> 00:20:10,962
会有九个小女孩想我到发疯
if I don't make an appearance at Jenna's.

524
00:20:11,187 --> 00:20:13,201
我不懂  她是很好玩还是怎么
I'm confused. I-Is she fun?

525
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,861
来吧
Come on.

526
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:19,541
好车
Ooh, nice ride!

527
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:21,257
再见啦
Bye-bye!

528
00:20:21,585 --> 00:20:22,260
-回头见  -再见啦
- See ya later! - Bye!

529
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:24,556
-再见  -再见
- Bye! - Bye!

530
00:20:24,658 --> 00:20:26,080
天啊  卢克在开车
Oh, my gosh! Luke is driving!

531
