他们甜点都还没吃就跑了
They didn't even stay for dessert!

532
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:30,180
天啊  他们真的走了
Oh, God. They're really gone.

533
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,681
好伤心
It's so sad.

534
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,288
但我们不就一直期待著这天吗
But isn't it what we hoped for?

535
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:33,900
-是啊  -是
- Yeah. - Yeah.

536
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:35,421
敬一杯
A toast.

537
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,898
我们把他们养育成独立的人
We raised them to be independent,

538
00:20:37,919 --> 00:20:39,820
现在他们要步入社会  开始自己的人生
and now they're out in the world having their own lives.

539
00:20:39,940 --> 00:20:40,292
我们成功了
We did it.

540
00:20:40,329 --> 00:20:41,963
-敬一杯  -敬我们
- Salud! - To us!

541
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,391
抱歉错过刚才那段
Oh, sorry I missed the first part,

542
00:20:43,411 --> 00:20:44,617
但你们敬什么事我都愿意喝一杯
but I'll drink to whatever you're toasting.

543
00:20:44,862 --> 00:20:45,720
给我加点酒
Top me off!

544
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:51,821
你在干嘛
Uh...what are you doing?

545
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:53,385
我在寻找
Well, I'm just trying to see

546
