她喜欢意大利老片吗
She likes Italian films?

552
00:21:05,077 --> 00:21:05,954
难怪她会觉得
Well, no wonder she thought

553
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:07,665
动画片《冰河时代5》很无聊
Collision Course" was boring.

554
00:21:07,848 --> 00:21:08,540
我喜欢啊
I liked it.

555
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:09,442
再来看看还有什么
Okay. What else?

556
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:13,298
莉莉跟州长握手的照片
A photo of Lily shaking hands with the governor?!

557
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:15,157
什么  什么时候
What? When?!

558
00:21:15,177 --> 00:21:16,768
好  我们得多加关注她了
Okay, maybe we need to start paying more attention.

559
00:21:17,115 --> 00:21:18,380
俗话说  没坏就别...
Or if it ain't broke...

560
00:21:19,320 --> 00:21:20,961
-...硬修了  她没事的  -挺好的
- Yeah, she's fine. - She's fine.
